00:14:27.570 --> 00:14:31.410
Will, who so graciously
has hosted this party.

00:14:31.410 --> 00:14:32.700
So give it up for Will.

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:36.150
As a token of gratitude for hosting

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.470
we wanted to help pay rent.

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:41.070
So here is some money

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:44.793
for helping us do that.

00:14:46.380 --> 00:14:47.413
And here you go.

00:14:48.555 --> 00:14:52.680
(everybody cheers)

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:54.090
I'm really happy you're all here.

00:14:54.090 --> 00:14:55.350
So you guys all have poems,

00:14:55.350 --> 00:14:57.630
so we're gonna read some poems.

00:14:57.630 --> 00:14:58.463
And also,

00:14:58.463 --> 00:15:01.965
I also want to shout out Heelys
for sponsoring this event.

00:15:01.965 --> 00:15:05.545
(everybody cheers)

00:15:05.545 --> 00:15:08.160
(everybody cheers)

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:10.470
I'm so grateful that
everyone came to this party

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:12.270
and a super big shout out to Heelys

00:15:12.270 --> 00:15:14.220
for helping sponsor the event.

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.660
In fact, Heelys was kind enough

00:15:15.660 --> 00:15:17.190
to send some of our party guests,

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.963
their own pair of Heelys.

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.670
- I love Heelys.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:26.280
- Whether it's in a
class or on the street,

00:15:26.280 --> 00:15:28.470
meeting new friends can be pretty neat.

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:30.132
- But through this incredibly hectic mess,

00:15:30.132 --> 00:15:31.740
the random people you meet,

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.180
when you just say, "Yes",

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:34.961
it's what makes this city it's best.

00:15:34.961 --> 00:15:37.878
(everybody cheers)

00:15:39.104 --> 00:15:43.320
(soothing music)

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.190
- [Sam] I really appreciate you

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:45.319
taking the chance.

00:15:45.319 --> 00:15:46.603
- Dude, I'm glad I did it.

00:15:46.603 --> 00:15:48.276
- Thanks for saying yes.

00:15:48.276 --> 00:15:51.750
We thought that no one was
gonna show up, earlier today.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:52.583
We were really worried.

00:15:52.583 --> 00:15:53.416
People were dropping out

00:15:53.416 --> 00:15:55.500
and like, look at all
these people behind us.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.978
All right, is everyone ready?

00:15:56.978 --> 00:15:59.491
(photo clicks)

